    "text": [
        {
            "jpName": "アグネスタキオン",
            "enName": "Agnes Tachyon",
            "jpText": "やぁやぁカフェ。\r\nちょっとばかり筋肉増強効果のある\r\nドリンクを作ってみたんだが――",
            "enText": "Well, if it isn't Cafe. I just happen to have\nfinished developing a drink that will increase\nyour muscle mass significantly…",
            "nextBlock": 2,
            "voiceIdx": 0,
            "pathId": -2831112393433079965,
            "blockIdx": 1
        },
        {
            "jpName": "マンハッタンカフェ",
            "enName": "Manhattan Cafe",
            "jpText": "……そうですか。\r\n飲みません……。",
            "enText": "…That's nice. I'm not drinking it.",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "voiceIdx": 1,
            "pathId": -288303911151008257,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アグネスタキオン",
            "enName": "Agnes Tachyon",
            "jpText": "そう、その通り。決して飲んでは\r\nいけないんだ。どれほど飲みたく\nなろうともね。絶対にだ。",
            "enText": "Yes, those are my thoughts as well.\nI will not allow you to drink this…\nno matter <i>how</i> hard you beg.",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "pathId": -7657496829173611459,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アグネスタキオン",
            "enName": "Agnes Tachyon",
            "jpText": "…………チラッ。",
            "enText": "……<i>glance</i>.",
            "nextBlock": 5,
            "voiceIdx": 3,
            "pathId": -6481211275662354862,
            "blockIdx": 4
        },
        {
            "jpName": "マンハッタンカフェ",
            "enName": "Manhattan Cafe",
            "jpText": "なんですか……？\r\n用がないなら、行ってください……。",
            "enText": "Okay? Then if you don't need anything,\ndo you mind leaving…?",
            "nextBlock": 6,
            "voiceIdx": 4,
            "pathId": -7056370744321740104,
            "blockIdx": 5
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アグネスタキオン",
            "enName": "Agnes Tachyon",
            "jpText": "……ふむ、駄目だったか。\r\n『カリギュラ効果』と言って、禁止された\nものほど欲しくなる現象があるんだが――",
            "enText": "Hmph… Well, there goes that plan. I had\nheard some people are susceptible to the\nCaligula Effect, or a desire to do that which\nis forbidden…",
            "nextBlock": 7,
            "voiceIdx": 5,
            "pathId": -1937549317658066436,
            "blockIdx": 6
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アグネスタキオン",
            "enName": "Agnes Tachyon",
            "jpText": "ドリンクを欲しがらないということは、\r\n君には当てはまらないようだ。\n非常に残念だが、他を当たるとしよう。",
            "enText": "But from your lack of interest, I see that is\nnot the case for you. How unfortunate. I shall\nhave to look elsewhere for a volunteer.",
            "nextBlock": 8,
            "voiceIdx": 6,
            "pathId": 1065518071043883811,
            "blockIdx": 7
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アグネスタキオン",
            "enName": "Agnes Tachyon",
            "jpText": "…………チラッ。",
            "enText": "……<i>glance</i>.",
            "nextBlock": 9,
            "voiceIdx": 7,
            "pathId": 5783228322892043258,
            "blockIdx": 8
        },
        {
            "jpName": "マンハッタンカフェ",
            "enName": "Manhattan Cafe",
            "jpText": "他を当たるんでしょう……？\r\nそれとも……まだ何か？",
            "enText": "Well? Are you going or not?\nWhatever you're trying to do, it won't work.",
            "nextBlock": 10,
            "voiceIdx": 8,
            "pathId": -1526730909420939340,
            "blockIdx": 9
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アグネスタキオン",
            "enName": "Agnes Tachyon",
            "jpText": "うぅ～～ん！！　駄目かーー！！",
            "enText": "Ohhh, drat!!",
            "nextBlock": -1,
            "voiceIdx": 9,
            "pathId": 6672104513197163225,
            "blockIdx": 10
        }
    ],
